# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository for all text files.
# Keeps Lean sources byte-identical across the two machines you build on and
# avoids spurious CRLF/LF diffs. Git still checks out your platform's native
# endings in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
